  "questions": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "认识新朋友时，你通常更容易被什么样的人吸引？",
      "options": {
        "A": {
          "text": "温暖随和、让人放松的人，和他们在一起不用刻意找话题。",
          "archetype": "A",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "emotional_warmth": 3,
            "security_base": 2,
            "boundary_intrusion": 0
          }
        },
        "B": {
          "text": "靠谱稳重、有边界感的人，和他们相处我知道自己该怎么做。",
          "archetype": "B",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "control_intensity": 2,
            "security_base": 1
          }
        },
        "C": {
          "text": "优秀上进、有追求的人，和优秀的人在一起能激励我变得更好。",
          "archetype": "C",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "conditional_love": 2
          }
        },
        "D": {
          "text": "没什么特别偏好，随缘吧，反正大多数关系最后都会渐行渐远。",
          "archetype": "D",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "emotional_neglect": 2,
            "security_base": 1
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "你做了一件错事，第一反应通常是？",
      "options": {
        "A": {
          "text": "承认错误，找人聊聊怎么弥补，不觉得犯错天会塌下来。",
          "archetype": "A",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "emotional_warmth": 2,
            "security_base": 0,
            "boundary_intrusion": 0,
            "emotional_neglect": 0,
            "control_intensity": 0,
            "conditional_love": 0
          }
        },
        "B": {
          "text": "本能地紧张，先想怎么解释或掩饰，害怕被人知道后的后果。",
          "archetype": "B",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "control_intensity": 2,
            "emotional_neglect": 1
          }
        },
        "C": {
          "text": "立刻开始复盘自己哪里做得不好，制定改进方案，绝不允许再犯。",
          "archetype": "C",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "conditional_love": 2,
            "control_intensity": 1
          }
        },
        "D": {
          "text": "内心毫无波澜，错了就错了，反正也没人会在意。",
          "archetype": "D",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "boundary_intrusion": 2,
            "emotional_neglect": 1
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "周末没有安排时，你更可能的状态是？",
      "options": {
        "A": {
          "text": "安心放松，做点喜欢的事，觉得这是属于自己的时间。",
          "archetype": "A",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "emotional_warmth": 2,
            "security_base": 2,
            "boundary_intrusion": 0
          }
        },
        "B": {
          "text": "总觉得应该做点什么有意义的事，闲着会让我有些不安。",
          "archetype": "B",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "control_intensity": 1,
            "emotional_neglect": 1
          }
        },
        "C": {
          "text": "有点焦虑，觉得别人都在进步，自己躺平就会落后。",
          "archetype": "C",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "emotional_neglect": 2,
            "emotional_warmth": 1
          }
        },
        "D": {
          "text": "习惯独处，但也说不上享受，就是不知道能约谁、找谁。",
          "archetype": "D",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "emotional_neglect": 2,
            "security_base": 1
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "需要做一个重要决定时，你通常怎么选？",
      "options": {
        "A": {
          "text": "会听听身边人的建议，但最终相信自己的判断。",
          "archetype": "A",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "emotional_warmth": 2,
            "security_base": 1
          }
        },
        "B": {
          "text": "反复权衡利弊，选那个最稳妥、最不容易出错的。",
          "archetype": "B",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "control_intensity": 2,
            "security_base": 1
          }
        },
        "C": {
          "text": "选那个看起来最拿得出手、说出来不会让人失望的。",
          "archetype": "C",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "conditional_love": 2,
            "control_intensity": 1
          }
        },
        "D": {
          "text": "拖到最后不得不选，或者干脆让别人帮我拿主意。",
          "archetype": "D",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "emotional_neglect": 2,
            "boundary_intrusion": 1
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "你取得了一个不错的成绩，你第一个想告诉谁？",
      "options": {
        "A": {
          "text": "会自然地分享给亲近的人，知道他们会真心为我高兴。",
          "archetype": "A",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "emotional_warmth": 3,
            "conditional_love": 0
          }
        },
        "B": {
          "text": "会告诉家人或领导，觉得有义务汇报一下，证明自己没让人失望。",
          "archetype": "B",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "conditional_love": 1,
            "control_intensity": 1
          }
        },
        "C": {
          "text": "看情况吧，不太确定对方是真的想听，还是只是礼貌回应。",
          "archetype": "C",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "conditional_love": 3,
            "emotional_warmth": 1
          }
        },
        "D": {
          "text": "想了想还是算了，好像说出去也没什么意义，自己知道就好。",
          "archetype": "D",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "emotional_neglect": 2,
            "emotional_warmth": 1
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "有人靠你很近说话或翻看你的手机时，你的感觉是？",
      "options": {
        "A": {
          "text": "没什么特别感觉，信任的人靠近很自然，不太在意这些。",
          "archetype": "A",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "boundary_intrusion": 0,
            "emotional_warmth": 1
          }
        },
        "B": {
          "text": "很不舒服，会本能地往后退或把手机收起来，感觉被冒犯。",
          "archetype": "B",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "control_intensity": 1,
            "boundary_intrusion": 2
          }
        },
        "C": {
          "text": "表面上保持微笑和配合，但心里会暗暗记下这个不太舒服的瞬间。",
          "archetype": "C",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "boundary_intrusion": 1,
            "conditional_love": 1
          }
        },
        "D": {
          "text": "有点困惑，不太确定自己是否有权利说不或者拒绝对方。",
          "archetype": "D",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "boundary_intrusion": 2,
            "emotional_neglect": 1
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "text": "当你感到身心俱疲时，你通常会怎么做？",
      "options": {
        "A": {
          "text": "主动找信任的人倾诉或寻求帮助，不介意暴露脆弱。",
          "archetype": "A",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "emotional_warmth": 3,
            "security_base": 1,
            "emotional_neglect": 0
          }
        },
        "B": {
          "text": "自己扛着，等扛过去了再说，不想让人觉得我脆弱或麻烦。",
          "archetype": "B",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "emotional_neglect": 2,
            "control_intensity": 0
          }
        },
        "C": {
          "text": "会在别人面前展示一小部分疲惫，确保看起来不那么惨，又不会被说冷漠。",
          "archetype": "C",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "conditional_love": 2,
            "emotional_warmth": 1
          }
        },
        "D": {
          "text": "心里希望有人发现我的状态不好，但如果没人注意到，也不会主动开口。",
          "archetype": "D",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "emotional_neglect": 2,
            "security_base": 1
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "text": "和别人发生矛盾后，你通常的反应是？",
      "options": {
        "A": {
          "text": "吵完了就翻篇，不会记仇，觉得沟通清楚就好。",
          "archetype": "A",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "security_base": 1,
            "emotional_warmth": 2,
            "emotional_neglect": 0
          }
        },
        "B": {
          "text": "表面假装没事，但内心会冷战，等着对方先低头。",
          "archetype": "B",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "emotional_neglect": 2,
            "control_intensity": 0
          }
        },
        "C": {
          "text": "会反思是不是自己的问题，然后主动去修复关系，哪怕不是自己的错。",
          "archetype": "C",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "boundary_intrusion": 2,
            "control_intensity": 1
          }
        },
        "D": {
          "text": "直接回避，觉得解释和争吵都没用，不如让时间冲淡一切。",
          "archetype": "D",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "emotional_neglect": 1,
            "boundary_intrusion": 1,
            "security_base": 0
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "text": "别人送你一件你并不需要或喜欢的礼物，你会？",
      "options": {
        "A": {
          "text": "真心感谢对方的心意，但也会坦诚地告诉对方我更喜欢什么。",
          "archetype": "A",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "boundary_intrusion": 0,
            "emotional_warmth": 1,
            "conditional_love": 0
          }
        },
        "B": {
          "text": "装作很喜欢的样子，内心却因为辜负了别人的心意而自责。",
          "archetype": "B",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "conditional_love": 1,
            "control_intensity": 1
          }
        },
        "C": {
          "text": "会想：这个礼物是送给我本人的，还是送给他们心目中那个「应该的我」？",
          "archetype": "C",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "conditional_love": 2,
            "boundary_intrusion": 1
          }
        },
        "D": {
          "text": "有点不知所措，不太习惯收到礼物，甚至觉得受之有愧。",
          "archetype": "D",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "emotional_neglect": 2,
            "conditional_love": 1
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "text": "回想你情绪最崩溃的一次，当时的场景是？",
      "options": {
        "A": {
          "text": "有人陪在我身边，没有说太多话，但让我感觉不是一个人。",
          "archetype": "A",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "emotional_warmth": 3,
            "emotional_neglect": 0
          }
        },
        "B": {
          "text": "我被要求「别哭了，哭解决不了问题」，然后情绪被硬生生压了回去。",
          "archetype": "B",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "control_intensity": 2,
            "emotional_warmth": 1
          }
        },
        "C": {
          "text": "我躲起来哭，哭完还装作什么都没发生过，不想给别人添麻烦。",
          "archetype": "C",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "emotional_neglect": 1,
            "security_base": 0
          }
        },
        "D": {
          "text": "哭了也没人注意到，或者被人说「至于嘛」，从此学会了不再轻易掉眼泪。",
          "archetype": "D",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "emotional_neglect": 3,
            "emotional_warmth": 0
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "text": "你怎么看待求助这件事？",
      "options": {
        "A": {
          "text": "需要的时候就开口，不觉得丢人，别人需要时我也会帮忙。",
          "archetype": "A",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "emotional_warmth": 3,
            "security_base": 1
          }
        },
        "B": {
          "text": "尽量不求人，求人前要做好充分的准备和理由，不能让人觉得我不行。",
          "archetype": "B",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "control_intensity": 2,
            "boundary_intrusion": 1
          }
        },
        "C": {
          "text": "偶尔求助，但会精确计算分寸，不能让对方觉得我太麻烦或太依赖。",
          "archetype": "C",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "conditional_love": 2,
            "emotional_warmth": 1
          }
        },
        "D": {
          "text": "基本不会主动求助，觉得说了也没用，还是自己解决更靠谱。",
          "archetype": "D",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "emotional_neglect": 2,
            "security_base": 1
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "text": "面对自己的缺点时，你内心的声音更接近？",
      "options": {
        "A": {
          "text": "人都有不完美的地方，接受它，不影响我成为一个还不错的人。",
          "archetype": "A",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "emotional_warmth": 1,
            "security_base": 0
          }
        },
        "B": {
          "text": "你怎么总是不够好？再努力一点，别让别人发现你的短板。",
          "archetype": "B",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "control_intensity": 2,
            "conditional_love": 1
          }
        },
        "C": {
          "text": "只要别人不发现，这个缺点就等于不存在。",
          "archetype": "C",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "conditional_love": 2,
            "boundary_intrusion": 1
          }
        },
        "D": {
          "text": "我不太确定怎么样算好、怎么样算不好，标准一直在变。",
          "archetype": "D",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "boundary_intrusion": 2,
            "emotional_neglect": 2,
            "conditional_love": 2
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "text": "如果要离开一个待了很久的地方或状态，你的内心感受是？",
      "options": {
        "A": {
          "text": "有些不舍，但也期待新的开始，相信美好会延续下去。",
          "archetype": "A",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "security_base": 3,
            "emotional_warmth": 1
          }
        },
        "B": {
          "text": "如释重负终于自由了，但同时又有些不安，不确定自己能不能搞定。",
          "archetype": "B",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "security_base": 1,
            "control_intensity": 1
          }
        },
        "C": {
          "text": "告诉自己要理性，不要太多愁善感，往前走就对了。",
          "archetype": "C",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "emotional_neglect": 2,
            "security_base": 1
          }
        },
        "D": {
          "text": "反复确认自己是否做了正确的决定，担心一转身就回不去了。",
          "archetype": "D",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "security_base": 2,
            "emotional_neglect": 1
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "text": "关于心里话这件事，你更接近哪种状态？",
      "options": {
        "A": {
          "text": "想说就说，不想说也不觉得有压力，分享是自然的不是被迫的。",
          "archetype": "A",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "boundary_intrusion": 0,
            "security_base": 1,
            "emotional_warmth": 1
          }
        },
        "B": {
          "text": "不太敢说心里话，怕被抓住把柄或成为别人评判我的依据。",
          "archetype": "B",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "boundary_intrusion": 2,
            "control_intensity": 1
          }
        },
        "C": {
          "text": "会说一部分，但会筛选什么该说什么不该说，害怕说错话让人失望。",
          "archetype": "C",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "boundary_intrusion": 2,
            "emotional_warmth": 1
          }
        },
        "D": {
          "text": "不太确定什么该分享什么不该，从小就没有人真正问过我的想法。",
          "archetype": "D",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "boundary_intrusion": 3,
            "emotional_neglect": 1
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "text": "当别人获得了你也很想要的东西，你内心的第一反应是？",
      "options": {
        "A": {
          "text": "有点羡慕但不会嫉妒，别人值得，我继续努力也会有。",
          "archetype": "A",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "emotional_warmth": 1,
            "security_base": 1
          }
        },
        "B": {
          "text": "会提醒自己要更努力，必须做得更好才能被看见、被肯定。",
          "archetype": "B",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "conditional_love": 2,
            "control_intensity": 1
          }
        },
        "C": {
          "text": "告诉自己不要抱太大期待，期待越少失望就越小。",
          "archetype": "C",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "emotional_neglect": 1,
            "conditional_love": 1
          }
        },
        "D": {
          "text": "松一口气，被关注其实是压力，不被注意反而更轻松自由。",
          "archetype": "D",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "emotional_neglect": 1,
            "conditional_love": 1,
            "boundary_intrusion": 1
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "text": "你怎么看待生活中那些规矩？",
      "options": {
        "A": {
          "text": "大多数规则有它的道理，但必要时也可以灵活变通。",
          "archetype": "A",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "security_base": 2,
            "control_intensity": 0
          }
        },
        "B": {
          "text": "会尽量遵守，违反规则会让我感到不安和焦虑。",
          "archetype": "B",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "control_intensity": 2,
            "security_base": 1
          }
        },
        "C": {
          "text": "有些矛盾——有的规则值得遵守，有的只是别人用来约束我的工具。",
          "archetype": "C",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "boundary_intrusion": 2,
            "security_base": 1,
            "control_intensity": 1
          }
        },
        "D": {
          "text": "不太在意，因为我经历的规则总是在变，适应就好。",
          "archetype": "D",
          "dimension_scores": {
            "emotional_neglect": 2,
            "security_base": 2
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "text": "你是在什么时候意识到我长大了的？",
      "options": {
        "A": {
